# A four-bar linkage: a fixed ground link, a crank, a coupler and a rocker, each a bar of
# set length. One degree of freedom: the crank's angle.
point pa at 0,0 fixed
point pd at 100,0 fixed
construction line ground from pa to pd
line crank from pa to 20,30 length 36
line coupler from crank.end to 90,60 length 80
line rocker from pd to coupler.end length 60
